    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>The train ride from La Marsa to Carthage was pretty exciting, in part because of the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.wired.com/2014/05/train-surfing/\">crazy</a> train <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sb289m_62A4\">surfers</a> that were on the sides and top of the train. Train surfing is incredibly dangerous - so, don't try this in Tunisia or at home!</p>"
    },
    {
